<item>
  <title>FCA decides to ban father and son following fraud and misuse of client money</title>
  <link>https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-ban-father-son-fraud-misuse-client-money</link>
  <description>
The FCA has decided to ban a father and son from UK financial services after the High Court found that they had engaged in fraud and misused client money.


